-- Version 18 to 19: removes every recorded conflict, because they describe edits that did not
-- happen.
--
-- Mirrors `V6__drop_manufactured_conflicts.sql`. Done on the device as well as the server
-- because a conflict is pulled into the local cache and stays there: clearing only the server
-- would leave the studio looking at exactly the same list.
--
-- A migration rather than a button. The studio did not create these and should not have to
-- dismiss them one at a time — 154 presses to acknowledge something that never occurred.
--
-- No schema change. Rows are removed.
--
-- These statements must produce exactly the schema the .sq files describe; the
-- verifyMigrations task compares the two and fails the build if they diverge.

DELETE FROM sync_conflict;
